<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2061966796"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1692699942"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="サインはB -New Arrange Ver.-"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="伊駒ゆりえ / 潘めぐみ / 大久保瑠美"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「【推しの子】」キャラクターソングCD Vol.2 歌：B小町 ルビー（CV：伊駒ゆりえ）、有馬かな（CV：潘めぐみ）、MEMちょ（CV：大久保瑠美）"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:41.712"><div begin="00:00.517" end="03:26.089"><p begin="00:00.517" end="00:03.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.517" end="00:00.707">ア・</span><span begin="00:00.707" end="00:01.106">ナ・</span><span begin="00:01.106" end="00:01.427">タ</span><span begin="00:01.427" end="00:01.660">の</span><span begin="00:01.660" end="00:02.008">ア</span><span begin="00:02.008" end="00:02.181">イ</span><span begin="00:02.181" end="00:02.526">ド</span><span begin="00:02.526" end="00:03.168">ル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只属于你的偶像</span></p><p begin="00:03.420" end="00:05.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:03.420" end="00:04.082">サイン</span><span begin="00:04.082" end="00:04.327">は</span><span begin="00:04.327" end="00:04.894">B♡</span><span begin="00:05.516" end="00:05.616">(チュ</span><span begin="00:05.616" end="00:05.877">ッ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暗号是B 啾♡</span></p><p begin="00:12.706" end="00:14.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:12.706" end="00:13.056">B</span><span begin="00:13.056" end="00:13.662">小町！</span><span begin="00:13.702" end="00:13.869">フッ</span><span begin="00:13.869" end="00:14.442">フー！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">B小町 哦呼！</span></p><p begin="00:15.464" end="00:17.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:15.464" end="00:15.814">B</span><span begin="00:15.814" end="00:16.370">小町！</span><span begin="00:16.460" end="00:16.613">フッ</span><span begin="00:16.613" end="00:17.200">フー！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">B小町 哦呼！</span></p><p begin="00:16.874" end="00:19.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:16.874" end="00:17.079">よう</span><span begin="00:17.079" end="00:17.198">やく</span><span begin="00:17.198" end="00:17.653">会え</span><span begin="00:17.653" end="00:17.999">たね</span> <span begin="00:18.065" end="00:18.586">嬉し</span><span begin="00:18.586" end="00:18.712">い</span><span begin="00:18.712" end="00:19.079">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于能与你相见了  真开心啊</span></p><p begin="00:19.079" end="00:22.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:19.079" end="00:19.475">待ち</span><span begin="00:19.475" end="00:19.751">遠</span><span begin="00:19.751" end="00:20.153">しく</span><span begin="00:20.153" end="00:20.395">て</span><span begin="00:20.453" end="00:20.939">足を</span><span begin="00:20.939" end="00:21.144">バッ</span><span begin="00:21.144" end="00:21.290">タ</span><span begin="00:21.290" end="00:21.518">バタ</span><span begin="00:21.518" end="00:21.902">しな</span><span begin="00:21.902" end="00:22.370">がら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迫不及待的心 让我难忍顿脚</span></p><p begin="00:22.370" end="00:27.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:22.370" end="00:22.808">今日</span><span begin="00:22.865" end="00:23.618">楽しみ</span><span begin="00:23.618" end="00:24.415">で</span><span begin="00:24.645" end="00:24.943">寝れ</span><span begin="00:24.943" end="00:25.481">なかっ</span><span begin="00:25.481" end="00:26.823">たよ</span><span begin="00:26.823" end="00:27.141">(オレ</span><span begin="00:27.141" end="00:27.822">モー！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">期待着今天 让我没法入眠啊（我也是！）</span></p><p begin="00:27.822" end="00:29.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:27.822" end="00:28.245">緊張</span><span begin="00:28.245" end="00:28.445">なんか</span><span begin="00:28.445" end="00:28.789">して</span><span begin="00:28.789" end="00:28.986">る</span><span begin="00:29.091" end="00:29.529">場合</span><span begin="00:29.529" end="00:29.688">じゃ</span><span begin="00:29.688" end="00:29.993">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在可不是能紧张的时候</span></p><p begin="00:30.013" end="00:33.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:30.013" end="00:30.767">１分</span><span begin="00:30.767" end="00:31.417">１秒</span> <span begin="00:31.484" end="00:31.952">無駄に</span><span begin="00:31.952" end="00:32.482">なんて</span><span begin="00:32.482" end="00:32.769">でき</span><span begin="00:32.769" end="00:33.320">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不能浪费这一分一秒</span></p><p begin="00:33.320" end="00:35.446" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:33.320" end="00:33.706">さあ</span><span begin="00:33.968" end="00:34.376">始め</span><span begin="00:34.376" end="00:34.489">ま</span><span begin="00:34.489" end="00:35.446">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好了 开始吧</span></p><p begin="00:35.476" end="00:37.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:35.476" end="00:35.925">君</span><span begin="00:35.925" end="00:36.166">も！</span> <span begin="00:36.301" end="00:36.609">君</span><span begin="00:36.609" end="00:36.882">も！</span> <span begin="00:36.980" end="00:37.273">君</span><span begin="00:37.273" end="00:37.545">も！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也！你也！你也！（收到！收到！）</span></p><p begin="00:36.167" end="00:37.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:36.167" end="00:37.380">ハーイ！ ハーイ！</span></p><p begin="00:37.557" end="00:38.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:37.557" end="00:38.808">お待ちどうさま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">久等了（好！好！好！好！）</span></p><p begin="00:37.380" end="00:38.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:37.737">ハイ！</span> <span begin="00:37.737" end="00:38.094">ハイ！</span> <span begin="00:38.094" end="00:38.450">ハイ！</span> <span begin="00:38.450" end="00:38.807">ハイ！</span></p><p begin="00:38.819" end="00:41.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:38.819" end="00:39.217">手を</span><span begin="00:39.217" end="00:39.477">鳴ら</span><span begin="00:39.477" end="00:39.943">せ</span> <span begin="00:39.960" end="00:40.256">いらっ</span><span begin="00:40.256" end="00:40.475">しゃ</span><span begin="00:40.475" end="00:40.737">い</span><span begin="00:40.737" end="00:41.183">ませ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拍响掌声吧 欢迎光临</span></p><p begin="00:41.183" end="00:44.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:41.183" end="00:41.560">「好き」</span><span begin="00:41.560" end="00:41.724">が</span><span begin="00:41.724" end="00:42.406">集まる</span><span begin="00:42.406" end="00:42.724">場所</span><span begin="00:42.724" end="00:42.972">へ</span><span begin="00:42.972" end="00:43.209">よう</span><span begin="00:43.209" end="00:43.567">こそ</span><span begin="00:43.567" end="00:43.965">(フワ！</span> <span begin="00:43.965" end="00:44.362">フワ！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢迎来到「喜欢」所聚集的地方（呼哇呼哇）</span></p><p begin="00:44.131" end="00:46.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:44.131" end="00:44.949">日常</span><span begin="00:44.949" end="00:45.376">は</span><span begin="00:45.376" end="00:45.776">クロー</span><span begin="00:45.776" end="00:46.015">ク</span><span begin="00:46.015" end="00:46.238">の</span><span begin="00:46.238" end="00:46.719">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将日常放入寄存处</span></p><p begin="00:46.719" end="00:49.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:46.719" end="00:47.096">ここに</span><span begin="00:47.096" end="00:47.386">来た</span><span begin="00:47.386" end="00:47.676">なら</span><span begin="00:47.772" end="00:48.208">踊ら</span><span begin="00:48.208" end="00:48.504">にゃ</span> <span begin="00:48.725" end="00:49.080">損！</span> <span begin="00:49.080" end="00:49.435">損！</span> <span begin="00:49.435" end="00:49.823">損！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来到这里了就一起跳舞吧 跳！跳！跳！</span></p><p begin="00:49.823" end="00:52.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:49.823" end="00:50.068">客席(ヒト)</span><span begin="00:50.068" end="00:50.195">が</span><span begin="00:50.195" end="00:50.348">居よう</span><span begin="00:50.348" end="00:50.491">が</span><span begin="00:50.491" end="00:50.885">居まい</span><span begin="00:50.885" end="00:51.186">が</span><span begin="00:51.186" end="00:51.761">関係</span><span begin="00:51.761" end="00:52.134">な</span><span begin="00:52.134" end="00:52.323">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论有无观览席都毫无关系</span></p><p begin="00:52.525" end="00:55.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:52.525" end="00:52.790">会場(ハコ)</span><span begin="00:52.790" end="00:52.914">が</span><span begin="00:52.914" end="00:53.270">大きい</span><span begin="00:53.270" end="00:53.587">小さい</span><span begin="00:53.587" end="00:53.939">とか</span><span begin="00:53.939" end="00:54.362">気に</span><span begin="00:54.362" end="00:54.523">し</span><span begin="00:54.523" end="00:54.959">な</span><span begin="00:54.959" end="00:55.112">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论会场是大是小都别在意</span></p><p begin="00:55.272" end="01:00.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="00:55.272" end="00:55.845">ちゃん</span><span begin="00:55.845" end="00:56.512">と</span><span begin="00:56.551" end="00:56.944">見え</span><span begin="00:56.944" end="00:57.208">て</span><span begin="00:57.208" end="00:57.876">る</span> <span begin="00:57.947" end="00:58.496">君の</span><span begin="00:58.496" end="00:58.872">サイ</span><span begin="00:58.872" end="00:59.102">リ</span><span begin="00:59.102" end="00:59.311">ウ</span><span begin="00:59.311" end="01:00.632">ム</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我有好好地看着 你的荧光棒</span></p><p begin="01:00.731" end="01:03.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:00.731" end="01:01.114">今は</span><span begin="01:01.114" end="01:01.361">フー</span><span begin="01:01.361" end="01:01.461">っと</span><span begin="01:01.534" end="01:01.882">吹け</span><span begin="01:01.882" end="01:01.990">ば</span><span begin="01:01.990" end="01:02.392">飛ぶ</span><span begin="01:02.392" end="01:02.740">よう</span><span begin="01:02.740" end="01:03.403">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我仅仅有着那不足道</span></p><p begin="01:03.466" end="01:06.105" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:03.466" end="01:03.876">小さな</span><span begin="01:03.876" end="01:04.225">小さな</span><span begin="01:04.225" end="01:04.554">才</span><span begin="01:04.554" end="01:04.989">能</span><span begin="01:05.031" end="01:05.339">だ</span><span begin="01:05.387" end="01:05.644">け</span><span begin="01:05.644" end="01:06.105">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛若一吹即飞的才能</span></p><p begin="01:06.105" end="01:14.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:06.105" end="01:06.955">私</span><span begin="01:06.955" end="01:07.385">を</span><span begin="01:07.598" end="01:08.219">推</span><span begin="01:08.219" end="01:08.319">し</span><span begin="01:08.319" end="01:08.481">て</span><span begin="01:08.481" end="01:08.868">くれ</span><span begin="01:08.868" end="01:09.334">るの</span><span begin="01:09.334" end="01:09.570">な</span><span begin="01:09.570" end="01:10.127">ら</span> <span begin="01:10.127" end="01:10.671">爆</span><span begin="01:10.671" end="01:11.386">レス</span><span begin="01:11.386" end="01:11.880">を</span><span begin="01:11.880" end="01:12.213">あ</span><span begin="01:12.213" end="01:12.447">げ</span><span begin="01:12.447" end="01:14.203">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可倘若你推我的话 我愿与你长时间对视</span></p><p begin="01:14.482" end="01:17.133" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:14.482" end="01:14.672">ア・</span><span begin="01:14.672" end="01:15.071">ナ・</span><span begin="01:15.071" end="01:15.392">タ</span><span begin="01:15.392" end="01:15.625">の</span><span begin="01:15.625" end="01:15.973">ア</span><span begin="01:15.973" end="01:16.146">イ</span><span begin="01:16.146" end="01:16.491">ド</span><span begin="01:16.491" end="01:17.133">ル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只属于你的偶像</span></p><p begin="01:17.467" end="01:19.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:17.467" end="01:18.129">サイン</span><span begin="01:18.129" end="01:18.374">は</span><span begin="01:18.374" end="01:18.941">B♡</span><span begin="01:19.563" end="01:19.663">(チュ</span><span begin="01:19.663" end="01:19.924">ッ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暗号是B 啾♡</span></p><p begin="01:28.191" end="01:30.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:28.191" end="01:28.461">あいつ</span><span begin="01:28.461" end="01:28.561">は</span><span begin="01:28.561" end="01:29.015">俺が</span><span begin="01:29.015" end="01:29.672">育て</span><span begin="01:29.672" end="01:29.974">たっ</span><span begin="01:29.974" end="01:30.403">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她是由我培养出的</span></p><p begin="01:30.420" end="01:33.606" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:30.420" end="01:31.007">近い</span><span begin="01:31.007" end="01:31.784">将来</span> <span begin="01:31.784" end="01:32.189">自慢</span><span begin="01:32.189" end="01:32.609">し</span><span begin="01:32.609" end="01:32.849">て</span><span begin="01:32.849" end="01:33.126">ほし</span><span begin="01:33.126" end="01:33.341">い</span><span begin="01:33.341" end="01:33.606">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你能在不久的将来 这样炫耀啊</span></p><p begin="01:33.646" end="01:35.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:33.646" end="01:34.065">こう</span><span begin="01:34.107" end="01:34.344">し</span><span begin="01:34.344" end="01:34.526">ちゃ</span><span begin="01:34.526" end="01:34.942">いら</span><span begin="01:34.942" end="01:35.254">れ</span><span begin="01:35.254" end="01:35.381">な</span><span begin="01:35.381" end="01:35.739">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但也不能一直这样</span></p><p begin="01:35.933" end="01:37.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:35.933" end="01:36.486">君と！</span> <span begin="01:36.659" end="01:37.201">君と！</span> <span begin="01:37.338" end="01:37.865">今を！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你！与你！现在！（收到！收到！）</span></p><p begin="01:36.434" end="01:37.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:36.434" end="01:37.730">ハーイ！ ハーイ！</span></p><p begin="01:37.989" end="01:39.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:37.989" end="01:39.202">楽しまなきゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起尽情享受当下（好！好！好！好！）</span></p><p begin="01:37.765" end="01:39.192" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:37.765" end="01:38.122">ハイ！</span> <span begin="01:38.122" end="01:38.479">ハイ！</span> <span begin="01:38.479" end="01:38.835">ハイ！</span> <span begin="01:38.835" end="01:39.192">ハイ！</span></p><p begin="01:39.212" end="01:41.753" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:39.212" end="01:39.550">引き</span><span begin="01:39.550" end="01:39.817">こも</span><span begin="01:39.817" end="01:40.214">り</span><span begin="01:40.214" end="01:40.435">も</span><span begin="01:40.435" end="01:40.977">人</span><span begin="01:40.977" end="01:41.077">見</span><span begin="01:41.077" end="01:41.390">知り</span><span begin="01:41.390" end="01:41.753">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是宅家不出还是外出怕生</span></p><p begin="01:41.753" end="01:44.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:41.753" end="01:42.397">普段と</span><span begin="01:42.397" end="01:42.908">違う</span><span begin="01:42.908" end="01:43.301">顔</span><span begin="01:43.301" end="01:43.511">見せ</span><span begin="01:43.511" end="01:43.844">て</span><span begin="01:43.844" end="01:43.947">よ</span><span begin="01:44.037" end="01:44.278">(フワ！</span> <span begin="01:44.278" end="01:44.600">フワ！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多让我看看与平时不同的表情吧</span></p><p begin="01:44.500" end="01:47.048" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:44.500" end="01:45.048">みんな</span><span begin="01:45.048" end="01:45.646">兄弟</span> <span begin="01:45.687" end="01:46.338">調子</span><span begin="01:46.338" end="01:46.583">どう</span><span begin="01:46.583" end="01:47.048">だい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大家都是一家人 现在感觉如何</span></p><p begin="01:47.048" end="01:50.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="01:47.048" end="01:47.508">なり</span><span begin="01:47.508" end="01:47.957">ふり</span><span begin="01:47.957" end="01:48.340">構わ</span><span begin="01:48.340" end="01:48.521">ず</span><span begin="01:48.521" end="01:48.861">に</span> <span begin="01:49.032" end="01:49.288">そう！</span> <span begin="01:49.288" end="01:49.735">そう！</span> <span begin="01:49.735" end="01:50.135">そう！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不用在乎他人的看法 对！对！对！</span></p><p begin="01:50.135" end="01:52.792" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="01:50.135" end="01:50.422">他人(ひと)</span><span begin="01:50.422" end="01:50.558">に</span><span begin="01:50.558" end="01:50.716">笑われ</span><span begin="01:50.716" end="01:50.985">て</span><span begin="01:50.985" end="01:51.217">いて</span><span begin="01:51.217" end="01:51.522">も</span><span begin="01:51.522" end="01:52.010">関係</span><span begin="01:52.010" end="01:52.524">な</span><span begin="01:52.524" end="01:52.792">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算被他人嘲笑也没关系</span></p><p begin="01:52.812" end="01:55.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="01:52.812" end="01:53.246">周りが</span><span begin="01:53.246" end="01:53.364">どう</span><span begin="01:53.364" end="01:53.588">とか</span><span begin="01:53.588" end="01:53.895">こう</span><span begin="01:53.895" end="01:54.221">とか</span><span begin="01:54.221" end="01:54.584">気に</span><span begin="01:54.584" end="01:54.731">し</span><span begin="01:54.731" end="01:55.254">な</span><span begin="01:55.254" end="01:55.492">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不用去在意周围的看法</span></p><p begin="01:55.561" end="02:00.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="01:55.561" end="01:55.896">主</span><span begin="01:55.896" end="01:56.605">張</span><span begin="01:56.844" end="01:57.248">強</span><span begin="01:57.248" end="01:58.110">すぎ</span> <span begin="01:58.246" end="01:58.520">君</span><span begin="01:58.520" end="01:58.883">の</span><span begin="01:58.883" end="01:59.286">サイ</span><span begin="01:59.286" end="01:59.418">リ</span><span begin="01:59.418" end="01:59.518">ウ</span><span begin="01:59.518" end="02:00.887">ム</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我看到 你那强烈主张的荧光棒</span></p><p begin="02:01.071" end="02:03.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:01.071" end="02:01.465">たとえ</span><span begin="02:01.465" end="02:01.766">世界</span><span begin="02:01.766" end="02:01.866">が</span><span begin="02:01.866" end="02:02.199">私</span><span begin="02:02.199" end="02:02.437">を</span><span begin="02:02.437" end="02:03.087">拒ん</span><span begin="02:03.087" end="02:03.695">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便世界拒绝了我</span></p><p begin="02:03.823" end="02:06.381" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:03.823" end="02:04.231">ひとり</span><span begin="02:04.231" end="02:04.333">ぼっ</span><span begin="02:04.333" end="02:04.433">ち</span><span begin="02:04.433" end="02:04.600">を</span><span begin="02:04.600" end="02:04.753">感</span><span begin="02:04.753" end="02:05.124">じ</span><span begin="02:05.124" end="02:05.371">た</span><span begin="02:05.371" e