02:54.623" end="02:55.046">気に</span><span begin="02:55.046" end="02:55.207">し</span><span begin="02:55.207" end="02:55.643">な</span><span begin="02:55.643" end="02:55.796">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论会场是大是小都别在意</span></p><p begin="02:55.942" end="03:01.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="02:55.942" end="02:56.515">ちゃん</span><span begin="02:56.515" end="02:57.182">と</span><span begin="02:57.221" end="02:57.614">見え</span><span begin="02:57.614" end="02:57.878">て</span><span begin="02:57.878" end="02:58.546">る</span> <span begin="02:58.617" end="02:59.166">君の</span><span begin="02:59.166" end="02:59.542">サイ</span><span begin="02:59.542" end="02:59.772">リ</span><span begin="02:59.772" end="02:59.981">ウ</span><span begin="02:59.981" end="03:01.302">ム</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我有好好地看着 你的荧光棒</span></p><p begin="03:01.413" end="03:04.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="03:01.413" end="03:01.796">今は</span><span begin="03:01.796" end="03:02.043">フー</span><span begin="03:02.043" end="03:02.143">っと</span><span begin="03:02.216" end="03:02.564">吹け</span><span begin="03:02.564" end="03:02.672">ば</span><span begin="03:02.672" end="03:03.074">飛ぶ</span><span begin="03:03.074" end="03:03.422">よう</span><span begin="03:03.422" end="03:04.085">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我仅仅有着那不足道</span></p><p begin="03:04.151" end="03:06.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="03:04.151" end="03:04.561">小さな</span><span begin="03:04.561" end="03:04.910">小さな</span><span begin="03:04.910" end="03:05.239">才</span><span begin="03:05.239" end="03:05.674">能</span><span begin="03:05.716" end="03:06.024">だ</span><span begin="03:06.072" end="03:06.329">け</span><span begin="03:06.329" end="03:06.790">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛若一吹即飞的才能</span></p><p begin="03:06.802" end="03:12.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="03:06.802" end="03:07.598"